  <!-- EN: T.R.I.S. suppressor-class shades -->
  <US_Terminators.label>T.R.I.S. 抑制器级墨镜</US_Terminators.label>
  <!-- EN: A large pair of retro sunglasses, a callback to the late 20th century. This pair of shades contain a hidden utility however, as they are fitted with a T.R.I.S. (short for Targeting and Reloading Intelligence System) subpersona AI. This AI's sole directive is to inform its wearer of hostile targets and moments of opportunity as quickly as possible. This emphasis on swift action puts a subtle but effective psychological pressure on the wearer to aim and reload as fast as humanly possible, at the cost of slightly reduced accuracy.\n        \nThese glasses also have a PLATE class shield generator built in that fully envelops the wearer's head. It acts similarly to standard armor, as while it does not provide perfect protection, it will never break from heat buildup, nor does it get in the way of projectile weaponry. The shield is also invisible, because having a giant bubble around the user's head would be a crime against fashion. Due to the fact that these shades are explicitly designed for combat, the shield generator is strengthened at the cost of being more expensive to produce. -->
  <US_Terminators.description>一副复古的大墨镜，让人回想起 20 世纪末。不过，这副墨镜还暗藏玄机，因为它装有一个 T.R.I.S.（瞄准和重装智能系统的简称）子人格人工智能。该人工智能的唯一指令就是尽快将敌对目标和机会通知佩戴者。这种对快速行动的强调给佩戴者带来了微妙而有效的心理压力，迫使其尽可能快地瞄准和装弹，但代价是精确度会略有下降。
        
这款眼镜还内置了一个 PLATE 等级的护盾发生器，可以完全包裹佩戴者的头部。它的作用类似于标准盔甲，虽然不能提供完美的保护，但绝不会因热量积聚而破裂，也不会妨碍射出的武器。防护罩也是隐形的，因为在使用者的头部有一个巨大的气泡会有违时尚。由于这些墨镜是专门为战斗而设计的，因此防护罩发生器得到了加强，但生产成本也更高。</US_Terminators.description>
</LanguageData>
